# The license of Outfit is the file its authors published, copied byte for byte from the official Google Fonts
# repository: line 21 ends with a space, and trimming it would change the license and break the SHA-256 that
# `docs/design-system.md` records and `tests/design-system.test.ts` compares. The exception lives here and not in the
# file, so the verbatim text stays verbatim and `git diff --check` does not report it as an error of this repository.
public/fonts/outfit/OFL.txt -whitespace

# The worklets of the voice session are the files of the installed packages, copied byte for byte by
# `npm run worklets:voice` and compared with them by `tests/voice-worklets.test.tsx`: the trailing spaces of
# `raw-audio-processor.js` are the ones ElevenLabs published, and trimming them would break the copy. The exception
# lives here and not in the file, so the verbatim text stays verbatim and `git diff --check` does not report it as an
# error of this repository.
public/voice/worklets/*.js -whitespace
